        "text": "1- LunchBox: Build a Truss with LunchBox\r\n\r\n- Build 2 Curves in Rhino and reference them inside Grasshopper.\r\n\r\n- Use the \"2D Truss\" and input both curves.\r\n\r\n- Feed a Number Slider in the N INPUT.\r\n\r\n- Hover over the T INPUT and check what it needs.\r\n\r\n- IMPORTANT!\r\nYou may realize that the resultant Truss has uneven divisions, to solve that, rebuild the curves using the \"Rebuild Curve\" component.",
